</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="about-photo-wrap fade-up">
      <div class="about-photo-frame">
        <div class="about-photo-placeholder">your photo here</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content fade-up">
      <p class="section-label">about me & education</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">A little bit <em>about me</em></h2>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>Hi! I'm Jocelyne! I'm a Canadian social media manager, content creator and former UGC creator. I've been in the social media, marketing, and content creation field since June 2023.</p>
        <p>I love being able to share my experiences and stories through posting content, and I am always looking for new opportunities.</p>
        <p>Although I don't have any formal education in marketing, I've gained most of my experience through actually applying what I've learned through my own research and real-world work — from growing my own pages to managing content for other brands.</p>
        <p>In November 2025, I started a social media marketing course to gain even more knowledge in the field.</p>
