          <span class="work-date">November 2025 — present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p class="work-desc">In November 2025, I created an Instagram page to promote my services under Neptune Social Studio — a social media management agency for beauty clinics and wellness brands based in Toronto. I use this page to advertise my services to potential clients and share knowledge in social media marketing and marketing psychology.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-numbers">
          <div class="work-num-item">
            <span class="work-num-val">Beauty</span>
            <span class="work-num-key">& Wellness niche</span>
          </div>
          <div class="work-num-item">
            <span class="work-num-val">Toronto</span>
            <span class="work-num-key">Based</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="work-item fade-up">
        <div class="work-meta">
          <span class="work-tag">UGC & Personal Brand</span>
          <span class="work-client-name">@theneptunianhour</span>
          <span class="work-date">June 2023 — present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p class="work-desc">Grew my personal TikTok as a Canadian UGC creator, producing lifestyle, vegan, and day-in-the-life content. Developed a consistent aesthetic and posting cadence to build an engaged community around my experiences and stories.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-numbers">
          <div class="work-num-item">
            <span class="work-num-val">1,140</span>
            <span class="work-num-key">Followers</span>
          </div>
          <div class="work-num-item">
            <span class="work-num-val">24.4K</span>
            <span class="work-num-key">Likes</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="work-item fade-up">
        <div class="work-meta">
          <span class="work-tag">Niche Content</span>
          <span class="work-client-name">@theetherealarcana</span>
          <span class="work-date">2023 — present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="work-body">
          <p class="work-desc">Managed and grew a niche TikTok for a mindset coach focused on spirituality, manifestation, and guidance. Created targeted content including tarot, astrology, and energetics videos to build an engaged audience in the spiritual wellness space.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-numbers">
          <div class="work-num-item">
            <span class="work-num-val">707</span>
            <span class="work-num-key">Followers</span>
